  chain="Understand the situation -> identify the quantities that matter -> make a rough estimate and check it makes sense -> an approximate answer shows if a result is reasonable or impossible and builds intuition; e.g. 20 thousand breaths x 0.5 litre = about 10,000 litres a day",
